{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"I've saved up a good amount by now, so I should tell the people at work soon."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
"Huh? I was sure I still had some disposable ones left."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Oh, there's just one. It's no use unless there are two, though... 
{PAUSE ""}
Well, whatever. People say wearing them doesn't make much difference anyway."<PG>
"I mean, it's not normal for just one to go missing. 
{PAUSE ""}
Could it be... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">that girl</STYLE>..."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
